            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The aim of the work was to review the current literature on the sacral-lumbar spine pains and on the factors that might be responsible for their incidence. The authors present the selection of therapeutic methods and the evaluation of their efficacy with special reference to sickness absence from work.</AbstractText>
